     "text": "K24 block + K20Z3 head (8th Si) or K24Z7 bottom + K20Z3 head (9th Si): K24Z7 head studs, relocated oil filter, Type-S oil pump kit, compatible 8th-gen Si header; keep K24Z7 timing parts and valve cover.",
     "conf": "forum"
